.TH SIG_CATCH 3
.SH NAME
sig_catch \- register a signal handler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "sig.h"
.PP
.BI "int sig_catch(int " sig ", sighandler_t_ref " f ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sig_catch
registers a handler function
.I f
to catch signal
.IR sig .
It configures the signal action with standard masks and flags (SA_MASKALL | SA_NOCLDSTOP). This function is MT-unsafe.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, or -1 on failure.